{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puppet: Hide And Seek</strong> - is a 7 vs 1 multiplayer horror game where one player takes on the role of a brutal Killer and seven other players are Survivors trying to escape from the killer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide And Seek</strong> - is a multiplayer horror game in (7 vs 1) mode, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where one player takes on the role of a brutal Killer, and seven other players are Survivors trying to escape the killer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU BE SAVED??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-user features</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of our in-game positional voice chat. Invite friends or find other players using the server browser. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in closets, walls, bushes, houses, but remember the main thing is your life is at stake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up or hide alone to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the allotted time and sail away into the sunset from this cursed island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play like everyone else or start <i><u>stand out</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can choose a character to your taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal of the Survivors in each game is to try not to get caught by the Killer and escape from the scene of the murders - it sounds easier than it really is.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2866420?t=1762425349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762425349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762425349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762425349","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puppet: Hide And Seek</strong> - is a 7 vs 1 multiplayer horror game where one player takes on the role of a brutal Killer and seven other players are Survivors trying to escape from the killer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide And Seek</strong> - is a multiplayer horror game in (7 vs 1) mode, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where one player takes on the role of a brutal Killer, and seven other players are Survivors trying to escape the killer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU BE SAVED??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-user features</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of our in-game positional voice chat. Invite friends or find other players using the server browser. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in closets, walls, bushes, houses, but remember the main thing is your life is at stake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up or hide alone to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the allotted time and sail away into the sunset from this cursed island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play like everyone else or start <i><u>stand out</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can choose a character to your taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal of the Survivors in each game is to try not to get caught by the Killer and escape from the scene of the murders - it sounds easier than it really is.</strong></p>","developers":["Sour Sugar"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866420/header.jpg?t=1762425349","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cl